# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Python (validator + tests are stdlib-only; no other runtime)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Local/dev state — never shipped. `.repete/` belongs here for the same
# reason as `.reload/` (#117.1): a sibling plugin's state dir is not project
# content, and `autobar` counts changed paths — an untracked `.repete/` feeds
# the arm decision. Whether the autobar pathspec should exclude sibling state
# dirs generally is deliberately NOT decided here (#117: widening
# `':(exclude).operator'` is a decision, not a tidy-up).
.archive/
.reload/
.remember/
.repete/

# Review-panel run reports (lens breakdown, finding counts, scoring). Same rule:
# HOW a doc got reviewed is scaffolding; WHY the code is shaped that way belongs
# in the doc itself. One was committed in 14d6ca9 and removed for 0.4.0.
.review-panel/

# Dogfooding /cc-operator:start in this repo materializes these at the root
/.operator/
/OPERATOR.md

# Misc
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
